My world collapsing</p><p ttm:agent="v1">My savior, beautiful lady</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Make me your god, I can give you everything</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When our darknesses overlap</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let me take it all away</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ruler of my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ruler of my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ruler of my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You are forever beautiful</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ruler of my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ruler of my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ruler of my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ruler of my heart, ruler of my heart, ruler of my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Ruler of my heart, ruler of my heart, ruler of my heart</p></div></body></tt>